#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:8
#: a23442a54e27445d9a5d41dadc7b73f6
msgid "ArduPilot Partners Program"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:10
#: 9b6f287a8c6249469d826727a13a8db9
msgid "The ArduPilot Project is the result of an immense amount of effort from software and hardware engineers, beta testers, web developers, documenters, researchers and many others.  A vast number of individuals, institutions and companies use and contribute to ArduPilot - in the spirit of Free and Open Source Software we freely and openly welcome their involvement in the project.  There is no cost to use, or contribute to, any software provided by ArduPilot. The Project does incur costs though, so this page explains our Partners Program for :ref:`corporate sponsors <common-partners>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:14
#: 9c51cedb09e042a18f324ca62633d0ef
msgid "Why a Partners Program"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:15
#: f1873074fe824b5c9daea9ce02e26793
msgid "ArduPilot is a free and open-source software project that includes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:17
#: adc3ca3a02e740978e275e08935a0ab0
msgid "Embedded firmware that is designed to serve as the control system for autonomous vehicles, and supports many different hardware targets listed on the Supported Hardware page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:18
#: 012770c957b54db49cd5e1e17b3bed29
msgid "A number of Ground Control Station software applications that allow management of vehicles running ArduPilot firmware, e.g. more convenient settings editing on an often more comfortable interface, firmware download and transfer, upgrading and conversion of settings between different devices and versions, fleet management, operations monitoring and more"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:19
#: 9425f179d4544773bbade7b01e6ecddb
msgid "The https://ardupilot.org website, https://discuss.ardupilot.org forum and this wiki"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:20
#: dd8b88545a834d20aa4a647ab7638991
msgid "Server infrastructure dedicated to distributing software and firmware, and testing/building/distributing of the different variants for all the different supported platforms and options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:21
#: fdb9eca5ef614962908948d0516d8d6a
msgid "A global community of users with an enormous variety of goals and expectations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:22
#: e16fa8fd5f2c458ab226ac1b8f610392
msgid "A global team of developers with deep technical knowledge of the project’s code and of its management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:24
#: 74da1c7ef6334d6382183e74e9689b16
msgid "In order to continue providing, maintaining and improving the rich ArduPilot ecosystem, the Project relies heavily on generous donations of time from many people - but we also incur financial costs that must be covered.  Simplistically, meeting these costs is what the Partners Program achieves."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:30
#: 06274a33e4d54cee961be59dd102a975
msgid "The partnerships we have with companies also help to guide the development of ArduPilot. We look to the partners to help us choose what features to prioritise, what documentation we need to work on and how we can best use the funds we have available to continue to make ArduPilot the best autopilot available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:37
#: dcd82b8f813c4606972fd5ded97500d6
msgid "Partner Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:39
#: a70cd495436245d79d971b17f25fea0f
msgid "One of the biggest benefits to a company of joining the partners program is the deep level of technical support that we can provide. For each partner we create a private discussion channel where the partner can ask questions, post logs for review or discuss features. We also have a shared channel that all partners can access to facilitate discussions between partners."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:46
#: faa5c97fb9fc442c9b01dde4d4d998cd
msgid "The partners program funds highly qualified support engineers to help support the needs of partners. These support engineers are not full time, but we do strive to provide very timely support for partners and we're proud of our track record of providing top quality support and technical advice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:52
#: 9378387342e2401ea61f08f88bc1b2f5
msgid "For more complex development tasks we may refer the partner to a dev team member who can provide more extensive paid consulting in a specialist area."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:57
#: 87e55c45a65f48c386bfd30985f4ffd8
msgid "Monthly Partners Call"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:59
#: 2f682abcdd0d462ebe4e69ceebfd361e
msgid "In addition to the private partner support channel, we also hold a monthly meeting that all partners are invited to where the core development team presents an update on the development of ArduPilot and discusses priorities with partners. We use this meeting to hold in-depth technical discussions with partners on any topic of interest, plus it gives an opportunity for partners to announce new products."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:67
#: 06d6b83219c2417497da5dab191de6ac
msgid "How does my company become a partner?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:69
#: ea7605a8befa4b2787df7b2be65303b2
msgid "The first step in becoming a partner is to email the partners program coordinator at `partners@ardupilot.org <mailto:partners@ardupilot.org>`__ to start the application process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:73
#: 9b28a1d485f1484abcb55b31220d201a
msgid "You will receive a reply within a couple of days. After that the steps are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:76
#: 40be02e2dd904078b171cf4b314ad01b
msgid "you will receive a link to a form to fill in giving details of your application"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:77
#: 0d6a51859dc04fb194000da60efd461b
msgid "you will need to agree to abide by the `ArduPilot Code of Conduct <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.html>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:78
#: 8bc20fe9d2e84cf4b25e651888f81ea6
msgid "companies interested in joining the program must demonstrate compliance with the `ArduPilot Code of Conduct <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/developer-code-of-conduct.html>`__, either by providing a link to their official website or through other verifiable means."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:79
#: 4e0f8d3e59bc4c13842126c457ab538a
msgid "you will need to make a payment of a minimum of US$1500. For larger companies we strongly encourage larger contributions, with typical amounts of $5000 to $10000 for companies that rely on ArduPilot for their business. Details of payment methods are given below"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:80
#: 589ac18111aa4fc886198c3fd02fc841
msgid "you will need to send a logo to put on our website, unless you specifically ask not to be included in the public list of partners"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:81
#: b7645a5f4d814550994c02e869c8f7bf
msgid "once payment is received we will create the private support channel for your company (on `discord <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ or skype) and add you to the partners list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:82
#: afc7e46e221141ebb6a698ffc94b2b66
msgid "the partners coordinator will setup a time to have an onboarding call to get to know you and to learn how we can best support your use of ArduPilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:83
#: 66e33a632f3a416889e7d151a6967a9d
msgid "you can then add the `ArduPilot Partner logo <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Logos/Partners/logos.html>`__ on your website to show your support for the ArduPilot project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:84
#: bbc0c45b698748a3aa3e8c38ed9501be
msgid "you will be added to the partners mailing list and partners discord channel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:85
#: 2bec10d299244a1691ab45d944159405
msgid "you will receive an invitation to the monthly partners development call"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:87
#: 203fab47f09943a9bfb92fe9fa62e65c
msgid "If you have not received a reply from the Partners Program Coordinator in 2 business days, please check the SPAM folder of your inbox. Otherwise, fill out `this form <https://forms.gle/pZN81bcjiVez7QpN9>`__ and the Coordinator will reach out to you shortly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:90
#: 9476ca8e18314397a745a9c37f4856be
msgid "Payment Methods"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:92
#: 2b8c566454e84516b42923e7bef0085d
msgid "After you have filled in the partner application form the partners coordinator will ask you to make your payment. We can accept payments in a number of ways."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:96
#: e14ccc0667bd404b891cc461a7ec5eee
msgid "the simplest and preferred method is via `paypal to the ArduPilot Foundation <https://ardupilot.org/donate>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:97
#: e16afc17f2cc453191d9410093b24858
msgid "you can do a bank transfer directly to the ArduPilot Foundation Australian bank account. The partners coordinator can give you the bank account details on request"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:98
#: c35dbfced7dc4bebbb4a3b957598a353
msgid "if neither of the first two options are suitable, you can donate via the SPI click and pledge system at `Click&Pledge <https://co.clickandpledge.com/advanced/default.aspx?wid=34115>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:99
#: e882c0b88dc34dd699a8c1b7834e6170
msgid "finally we can give you bank details for donating directly to our SPI US bank account"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:102
#: f9c29d3525894dea9831ee0bf41f8b00
msgid "How are collected funds spent?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:103
#: d51d6b33457943a3921eccbe10ca54eb
msgid "Funds are first used to cover fixed costs including servers to host the wiki, forum, autotest and build servers and other running expenses. We also fund 3 part time highly qualified support engineers to help partners with support, a Wiki documentation maintainer, and the partners coordinator position to ensure the partners program runs smoothly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:105
#: 95c84dcc8b584e34a2c20e7356b59843
msgid "A Funding Committee of 3 members is voted on annually from within the Development Team to oversee and control financial matters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:108
#: 7d26fc9816fb42aaa1d977248f709c2f
msgid "I'm not a company, but I love your work, how can I help?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:109
#: fcff34144e1b449ea15a5f61d57728ea
msgid "Please see our more general, :ref:`how-to-donate <common-donation>` page but in short, we accept donations of any amount from individuals as well.  Also please consider helping out with documentation, beta testing or code development.  Tell your friends and post videos of your successes with ArduPilot!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:112
#: 68191183123a45d48c19d51a287a7855
msgid "I want a new feature, do I have to be a partner to get it?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:113
#: dfa82505c6bf42efa32fc53cd724f3d4
msgid "No.  ArduPilot is, and always will be, open source.  Contributions to the code base, wherever they come from, are accepted based on their technical merits.  If you're not in a position to make the changes yourself, please add it to the `Issues list <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ or consider contracting one of the companies listed on the :ref:`Commercial Support page <common-commercial-support>` to make the change."
msgstr ""
